{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the foundation module authority becomes the workspace package @purin-labs/authority in foundation/authority. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder. sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from versionsFrom. edits: text edits of the files that name a root folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs, and of a path that is no import; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. package.typeCheck false: the package has no check:types script of its own. Its own files read the Env key CASE (actors/case-operations.ts, access-control/references.ts), which services/platform/src/actors/case.ts (workers/platform) merges with declare module of @purin-labs/kernel/env, and CommerceTypeParts.entityPlaneEffect (actors/action-ledger.ts), which services/platform/src/commerce/contract/types.ts (areas/commerce) merges into @purin-labs/kernel/commerce-type-parts. Through @purin-labs/actor-runtime and @purin-labs/tenancy the program also lacks ORGANISATION, SESSION and CONNECTOR. The package alone gives 45 errors. The Worker program checks its files.",
